WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Set Flower Robotics as the company and FlowerCare as the program. Choose a brand color.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Select proposed benefits and a 24-month sample plan term.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Preview the customer portal and try sample enrollment. No coverage is activated.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
Report an equipment issue and simulate a service request. Nothing is sent.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
